---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Terms" description="Starter terms-of-service structure for Southwind.">
  <article class="page-shell py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Legal template</p><h1 class="display-title mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold">Terms</h1><div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-7 text-muted"><p class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 text-foreground"><strong>Replace this page before launch.</strong> It is starter structure, not legal advice or production-ready terms.</p><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Using the service</h2><p class="mt-3">State who may use your service, account responsibilities, and acceptable-use expectations.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Subscriptions and payment</h2><p class="mt-3">Describe the plans, renewals, cancellation, refunds, and taxes that actually apply.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Service and liability</h2><p class="mt-3">Work with qualified counsel to define availability, warranties, limitations, and governing law.</p></section></div></div></article>
</SiteLayout>
